# AI Cyber Attack Response Coordinator using Multi-Agent AI

## Project Overview
This project develops a Multi-Agent AI system that detects cyber threats, analyzes attack types, decides appropriate responses, alerts the administrator, and generates incident reports through a modular architecture.

## Features
- Detection Agent
- Analysis Agent
- Decision Engine
- Response Agent
- Alert Agent
- Report Agent
- Streamlit Dashboard

## Cyber Attacks Covered
- Brute Force Attack
- Malware Attack
- DDoS Attack
- Unauthorized Access

## Technology Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- SQLite
- Streamlit

